<title>JAPAN: Nakagawa Musen - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nakagawa Musen - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 20, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    13.80		vs	   12.32</p>
<p> Operating	  148    million	  vs	  103    million</p>
<p> Current	    449    million	  vs	  353    million</p>
<p> Net		  234    million	  vs	  220    million</p>
<p> EPS		   10.20 yen	  vs	    9.81 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     24 million	  vs	  22 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nakagawa Musen Co Ltd is a medium-sized large-scale retailer of consumer electronics.</p>
</text>
